// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#define ZMK_POINTING_DEFAULT_MOVE_VAL 1000  // default: 600
#define ZMK_POINTING_DEFAULT_SCRL_VAL 30    // default: 10

#include <dt-bindings/zmk/input_transform.h>
#include <input/processors.dtsi>
#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/pointing.h>

#define mouse 3
#define mouse_fast 4
#define mouse_slow 5

&mmv {
    time-to-max-speed-ms = <10>;
    acceleration-exponent = <6>;
};

&msc {
    time-to-max-speed-ms = <10>;
    acceleration-exponent = <10>;
};

&lt {
};

&mt { flavor = "tap-preferred"; };

&mmv_input_listener {
    mouse_fast {
        layers = <4>;
        input-processors = <&zip_xy_scaler 3 1>;
    };
};

&mmv_input_listener {
    mouse_slow {
        layers = <5>;
        input-processors = <&zip_xy_scaler 1 3>;
    };
};

&msc_input_listener {
    scroll_fast {
        layers = <4>;
        input-processors = <&zip_scroll_scaler 2 1>;
    };
};

&msc_input_listener {
    scroll_slow {
        layers = <5>;
        input-processors = <&zip_scroll_scaler 1 2>;
    };
};

/ {
    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        left_esc {
            bindings = <&kp ESCAPE>;
            key-positions = <1 0>;
        };

        enter {
            bindings = <&kp RET>;
            key-positions = <16 17 18>;
            timeout-ms = <100>;
        };

        tab {
            bindings = <&kp TAB>;
            key-positions = <10 11>;
        };

        r_word {
            bindings = <&kp LA(RIGHT)>;
            key-positions = <18 17>;
            layers = <2 0>;
        };

        backspace {
            bindings = <&kp BACKSPACE>;
            key-positions = <18 19>;
            timeout-ms = <100>;
        };

        l_word {
            bindings = <&kp LA(LEFT)>;
            key-positions = <17 16>;
            layers = <0 2>;
            timeout-ms = <100>;
        };

        backspace2 {
            bindings = <&kp BACKSPACE>;
            key-positions = <16 35>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        backspace3 {
            bindings = <&kp BACKSPACE>;
            key-positions = <34 13>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        close_tab {
            bindings = <&kp LG(W)>;
            key-positions = <9 35>;
            layers = <2 3 6>;
        };

        new_tab {
            bindings = <&kp LG(T)>;
            key-positions = <35 19>;
            layers = <2 3 6>;
        };

        reopen_tab {
            bindings = <&kp LG(LS(T))>;
            key-positions = <35 30>;
            layers = <2 3 6>;
        };

        del_word {
            bindings = <&kp LA(BACKSPACE)>;
            key-positions = <35 16 17>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        del_word_fw {
            bindings = <&kp LA(DELETE)>;
            key-positions = <17 18 35>;
            layers = <0>;
        };

        bt_clear {
            bindings = <&bt BT_CLR>;
            key-positions = <34 20>;
            layers = <6>;
        };

        bt_0 {
            bindings = <&bt BT_SEL 0>;
            key-positions = <34 21>;
            layers = <6>;
        };

        bt_1 {
            bindings = <&bt BT_SEL 1>;
            key-positions = <34 10>;
            layers = <6>;
        };

        bt_2 {
            bindings = <&bt BT_SEL 2>;
            key-positions = <34 0>;
            layers = <6>;
        };

        reset {
            bindings = <&sys_reset>;
            key-positions = <34 0 10 21>;
            layers = <6>;
        };

        language_switch {
            bindings = <&kp LA(SPACE)>;
            key-positions = <34 35>;
        };
    };

    macros {
        personal_email: personal_email {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp M &kp U &kp R &kp Z &kp N4 &kp N2 &kp AT &kp G &kp M &kp A &kp I &kp L &kp DOT &kp C &kp O &kp M>;
            label = "PERSONAL_EMAIL";
        };

        work_email: work_email {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp I &kp L &kp I &kp A &kp DOT &kp M &kp U &kp R &kp Z &kp I &kp N &kp O &kp V &kp AT &kp R &kp E &kp V &kp O &kp L &kp U &kp T &kp DOT &kp C &kp O &kp M>;
            label = "WORK_EMAIL";
        };

        thinking_face: thinking_face {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp COLON &kp T &kp H &kp I &kp N &kp K &kp I &kp N &kp G &kp UNDER &kp F &kp A &kp C &kp E &kp COLON>;
            label = "THINKING_FACE";
        };

        name: name {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LS(I) &kp L &kp I &kp A>;
            label = "NAME";
        };

        last_name: last_name {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LS(M) &kp U &kp R &kp Z &kp I &kp N &kp O &kp V>;
            label = "LAST_NAME";
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        base {
            bindings = <
            &kp Q             &kp W        &kp E           &kp R    &kp T                  &kp Y                 &kp U  &kp I      &kp O    &kp P
            &mt LEFT_SHIFT A  &mt LCTRL S  &mt LEFT_ALT D  &lt 3 F  &kp G                  &kp H                 &kp J  &kp K      &kp L    &mt RSHIFT SEMI
&kp ESCAPE  &kp Z             &kp X        &kp C           &kp V    &kp B                  &kp N                 &kp M  &kp COMMA  &kp DOT  &kp LEFT_BRACKET  &kp SINGLE_QUOTE
                                           &mo 0           &mo 2    &mt LEFT_META SPACE    &mt RIGHT_META SPACE  &mo 1  &mo 6
            >;
        };

        sym {
            bindings = <
        &kp N1            &kp N2       &kp N3         &kp N4        &kp N5       &kp N6     &kp N7                &kp N8                 &kp N9           &kp N0
        &mt LSHIFT MINUS  &kp PLUS     &kp SLASH      &kp ASTERISK  &kp EQUAL    &kp GRAVE  &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS  &kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS  &kp EXCLAMATION  &mt RIGHT_SHIFT QUESTION
&trans  &kp UNDER         &kp PERCENT  &kp BACKSLASH  &kp AMPS      &kp PIPE     &kp TILDE  &kp LEFT_BRACKET      &kp RIGHT_BRACKET      &kp AT           &kp POUND                 &kp SLASH
                                       &trans         &trans        &mo 7        &trans     &trans                &trans
            >;
        };

        nav {
            bindings = <
        &kp LG(NUMBER_1)  &kp LG(NUMBER_2)  &kp LG(NUMBER_3)      &kp LG(NUMBER_4)       &kp LG(N5)    &none     &kp PAGE_DOWN             &kp PAGE_UP                &none      &none
        &kp LEFT_SHIFT    &kp LC(UP_ARROW)  &kp LC(LEFT)          &kp LC(RIGHT)          &none         &kp LEFT  &kp DOWN                  &kp UP                     &kp RIGHT  &none
&trans  &none             &none             &kp LG(LEFT_BRACKET)  &kp LG(RIGHT_BRACKET)  &none         &none     &kp LG(LS(LEFT_BRACKET))  &kp LG(LS(RIGHT_BRACKET))  &none      &none  &trans
                                            &none                 &none                  &none         &none     &none                     &none
            >;
        };

        mouse {
            bindings = <
       &none           &none  &none   &none  &none     &msc SCRL_RIGHT  &msc SCRL_UP              &msc SCRL_DOWN             &msc SCRL_LEFT   &none
       &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &mo 4  &mo 5   &none  &none     &mmv MOVE_LEFT   &mmv MOVE_DOWN            &mmv MOVE_UP               &mmv MOVE_RIGHT  &none
&none  &none           &none  &none   &none  &none     &none            &kp LG(LS(LEFT_BRACKET))  &kp LG(LS(RIGHT_BRACKET))  &none            &none  &none
                              &trans  &mo 5  &trans    &mkp MB1         &mkp MB2                  &none
            >;
        };

        mouse_fast {
            bindings = <
  &none
            >;
        };

        mouse_slow {
            bindings = <
  &none
            >;
        };

        media {
            bindings = <
       &none                 &none              &none          &none                  &none    &none             &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_DEC  &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_INC  &none       &none
       &kp LG(LA(LC(LEFT)))  &kp LA(LG(LC(F)))  &kp LG(LC(F))  &kp LA(LG(LC(RIGHT)))  &none    &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE  &kp C_VOL_DN          &kp C_VOLUME_UP       &kp K_MUTE  &none
&none  &none                 &none              &none          &none                  &none    &none             &none                 &none                 &none       &none  &none
                                                &none          &none                  &none    &none             &none                 &none
            >;
        };

        macros {
            bindings = <
       &thinking_face  &none       &none            &none        &none    &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
       &name           &last_name  &personal_email  &work_email  &none    &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
&none  &none           &none       &none            &none        &none    &none  &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
                                   &none            &none        &none    &none  &none  &none
            >;
        };
    };
};
